    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then number of non-empty subsets <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> such that the product of elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is even is :",
